#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:5
#: 70d46e152f3544b78844b20a9cc91e7f
msgid "THERMAL Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:7
#: 566dfdbc90a944e79473c12aa53947b2
msgid "If SOARING is enabled (:ref:`SOAR_ENABLE<SOAR_ENABLE>` = 1 and it has not been disabled by an RC switch (``RCx_OPTION =88``), this mode will idle the throttle, and begin circling searching for vertical lift."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:9
#: c1d0728a0734491f8042e3b9b5370ab0
msgid "This is the mode that is used for autonomous soaring (See :ref:`soaring-4_1`) and is automatically entered if a thermal is detected during the gliding portion of SOARING flight, and will begin circling searching for the lift center."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:11
#: 58e5c0f35e3e4c06a523627f716a2d15
msgid "THERMAL mode is exited under the following conditions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:13
#: 2bd7030800034f7fac95a0a13d4cbd2e
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MAX<SOAR_ALT_MAX>` is reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:14
#: e521e5212372417f891f6926fa88221b
msgid ":ref:`SOAR_ALT_MIN<SOAR_ALT_MIN>` is reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:15
#: 58e67eca6fed4a96acaf4a184db2b6f0
msgid "Flight mode is changed by the pilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:16
#: 32866d2815484b1b87828a48b8889caa
msgid "The estimate of achievable climb rate falls below :ref:`SOAR_VSPEED<SOAR_VSPEED>`, and thermalling has lasted at least :ref:`SOAR_MIN_THML_S<SOAR_MIN_THML_S>` seconds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:18
#: 14a8811586ff419e83fc290c9a5493c9
msgid "The aircraft drifts more than :ref:`SOAR_MAX_DRIFT<SOAR_MAX_DRIFT>` - see :ref:`Limit maximum distance from home<soaring_maximum-distance-from-home>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:20
#: 092c92fe9af94fb5bc2fd7e798c21c9c
msgid "The flight mode will be returned to whatever it was before THERMAL was triggered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:22
#: 8ca5b91af82b47fc8b82cf255837b37d
msgid "This mode can be triggered by the pilot from any mode (like FBWA) using the GCS or RC transmitter, in which case THERMAL mode will begin searching for lift until THERMAL mode exit conditions are met or the pilot commands a mode change"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/thermal-mode.rst:24
#: 67e6cbd7b10b4a1a893f0fde239f1b36
msgid "While in THERMAL mode, the airspeed target is set to :ref:`SOAR_THML_ARSPD<SOAR_THML_ARSPD>` (meters/sec) if its non-zero, otherwise, if \"0\" (default) it will be set to :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`."
msgstr ""
